1. { -KEY- } Kf7 $1 { Before taking the pawn White should prevent ...Ke8. } ( { In contrast, the obvious } 1. Be7 $2 Ke8 2. Bxf6 { fails after } Be3 3. Bh4 Bd4 4. Bg3 Bc3 5. Be5 Bxe5 6. Kxe5 Ke7 { etc. } ) 
