 { Here is a more complex example, where it is the stronger side that uses the 'King first!' idea.How should Black proceed? } 1... { -KEY- } Kd4 $1 { The king approaches the dangerous h pawn as soon as he can. } ( { In contrast, in the game Black lost a crucial tempo by snatching a pawn: } 1... Kxc4 $2 2. h6 Kd5 3. Kf5 Rf1 4. Kg6 Ke6 5. Kg7 $1 ( { avoiding } 4... Kd4 4. h7 $2 Rg1 6. Kh6 Kf7 $1 7. h8=N Kf6 8. Kh7 Rg2 { and Black wins } ) 
